    "title": "Continue ART during admission",
    "message": "Guidelines state that for admitted patients recently on ART, ART should be continued at admission, with regimen decisions made according to patient history, ART guidelines, viral load, and resistance testing where relevant. This patient is severely ill with dehydration and AKI; the plan does not state whether TLD will be continued during admission. Abrupt ART interruption during acute illness should be avoided unless specifically indicated.",
